[Term]
id: ENVO:01000245
name: cropland biome
def: "A cropland ecosystem in which dominant ecological communities are maintained in a stable state - mimicking a climax community - by human intervention." [http://dx.doi.org/10.1111/j.1466-8238.2010.00540.x, http://dx.doi.org/10.1890/070062]
