[Term]
id: ENVO:01000309
name: cold environment
def: "An environment which has a lower temperature than some local or global average." []
comment: The definition of the deprecated 'cold temperature habitat' class, which this class was derived from, quotes an upper threshold of 15 degrees Celsius for 'coldness'.
