relationship: RO:0002220 ENVO:01000324 ! adjacent to planetary surface

[Term]
id: ENVO:01000324
name: planetary surface
def: "A planetary surface is a surface layer where the solid or liquid material of a planet comes into contact with an atmosphere or outer space." []
