is_a: ENVO:01001483 ! surface of an astronomical body
intersection_of: ENVO:01001483 ! surface of an astronomical body
intersection_of: part_of ENVO:01000800 ! planet
relationship: part_of ENVO:01000800 ! planet

[Term]
id: ENVO:01000325
name: aquatic layer
def: "A layer in a water mass, itself composed primarily of water." []
