[Term]
id: ENVO:01000927
name: day care building
def: "A building which is used to care for a human child during the working day by a person, outside the child's immediate family, other than that child's legal guardians." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Day_care]
comment: This is a kind of day care facility. A facility need not be a building.
