relationship: BFO:0000066 ENVO:01000800 ! occurs in planet
relationship: RO:0002232 ENVO:01000983 ! has end location technosphere
property_value: IAO:0000116 "Whether this is within the planet's Hill sphere, the region which extends from its exosphere to its core, or some other planetary region is not clear." xsd:string

