property_value: IAO:0000116 "See https://github.com/EnvironmentOntology/envo/issues/1102 for a possible design pattern.\n\nUses undesirability standard, compared to polluted river's ecological impact standard. What is the relation to ENVO:00002114 'chemically enriched sediment'? Does 'element' in the definition refer to something found in the periosic table (like selenium) or the member of some set, aka an entity?" xsd:string
created_by: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157
creation_date: 2021-04-05T16:38:47.162Z

