id: FOODON:03412972
name: food additive
comment: Damion Dooley's note: manysubclasses here are currently originating from LanguaL additives that have not yet been matched to CHEBI ontology terms.  If matches are possible they will be implemented over time, at which point the corresponding FoodOn id's will be deprecated.
